---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<Layout
  title="Blockchain Founders Capital - We invest in founders building the future of the internet"
  description="Blockchain Founders Capital is an early-stage venture capital firm backing founders building the future of the internet."
>
  <section class="border-b border-slate-800 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-950 via-slate-950 to-slate-950/80">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-10 px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:gap-16 lg:px-8 lg:py-20">
      <div class="max-w-xl space-y-6">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-400">
          We invest in founders
        </p>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
          We invest in founders
          <br />
          building the future of the internet
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 sm:text-base">
          We are honored to back such fantastic teams on a mission.
        </p>
        <form class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <input
            type="email"
            required
            placeholder="Enter your email"
            class="h-11 flex-1 rounded-full border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/80 px-4 text-sm text-slate-50 placeholder:text-slate-500 shadow-soft focus:border-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-0"
          />
          <button
            type="submit"
            class="inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-50 px-6 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 shadow-soft hover:bg-white"
          >
            Subscribe to Newsletter
          </button>
        </form>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">
          Stay in the loop with updates on investments, portfolio firms, and events.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid w-full max-w-md grid-cols-1 gap-4 self-stretch sm:max-w-lg sm:grid-cols-2 lg:max-w-none">
        <article class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 shadow-soft">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-400">
              Herita
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-50">
              Creating the digital backbone for trade finance
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              By reimagining the Bill of Exchange for the digital era, Herita gives both buyers and suppliers more control over their cash flow.
            </p>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300">
            Founders: Christoph Iwaniez, Felix Kollmar, Benjamin Jones
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/60 p-5 shadow-soft">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-400">
              Silas
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-50">
              Turning data overload into confident decisions
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              Silas automates insurance underwriting workflows so teams can move faster with better insight.
            </p>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300">
            Founder: Maariyaah Afzal
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/60 p-5 shadow-soft sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-400">
              Appstack
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-50">
              Help mobile apps make more money
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              Appstack provides an AI-first fresh approach to mobile advertising measurement in a privacy-first world.
            </p>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300">
            Founders: Lucas Moscon, Tom Darmon
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="portfolio" class="border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/80">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:px-8">
      <header class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl">
            Portfolio
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-400">
            We are honored to back such fantastic teams on a mission.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a
          href="#connect"
          class="mt-2 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-slate-700/80 bg-slate-900/60 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-slate-100 shadow-soft hover:border-slate-500"
        >
          View open roles
        </a>
      </header>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 shadow-soft">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-50">Tergle</h3>
            <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-400">
              Making auditors love their jobs again
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              Transforming financial audits by leveraging AI to eliminate grunt work and unlock higher-value analysis.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-400">
            <p>Founders: Adam Bowen, William Tarr</p>
            <p class="mt-1">Co-investors: Y Combinator, Pioneer Fund, Amino Capital, Founders X Ventures, Palm Drive Capital, Nama Ventures, Network VC</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/50 p-5 shadow-soft">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-50">Raremarq</h3>
            <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-400">
              Marketplace for rare, human-crafted work
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              Building a marketplace around physical artifacts, human stories, and existing fan behaviors.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-400">
            <p>Founder: Christopher Tung</p>
            <p class="mt-1">Co-investors: Jason Calacanis, Eurie Kim</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 shadow-soft">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-50">Unified</h3>
            <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-400">
              Real-time unified API for AI-first apps
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              A master translator for software, helping SaaS applications speak the same language without endless custom code.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-400">
            <p>Founders: Roy Pereira, Alexey Adamsky</p>
            <p class="mt-1">Co-investors: TechStars, Developer Capital, LOI Venture</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 shadow-soft">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-50">Bayesline</h3>
            <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-400">
              Million-times faster risk models
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              Transforming financial risk models to deliver real-time results for modern markets.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-400">
            <p>Founders: Misha van Beek, Sebastian Janisch</p>
            <p class="mt-1">Co-investors: Y Combinator, 468 Capital, Multimodal Ventures</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 shadow-soft">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-50">Level</h3>
            <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-400">
              Permissionless onchain banking products
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              Stablecoin protocol issuing Level USD, backed by dollar-denominated tokens restaked on security protocols.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-400">
            <p>Founders: David Lee, Kedian Sun</p>
            <p class="mt-1">Co-investors: Dragonfly, Polychain Capital, Robot Ventures, Balaji Srinivasan</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 shadow-soft">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-50">Recall</h3>
            <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-400">
              Revolutionize how we manage information
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              Rethinking how we manage, organize, and utilize information in the age of AI.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-400">
            <p>Founders: Paul Richards, Igor Gligorević, Sankari Nair</p>
            <p class="mt-1">Co-investors: Launch Accelerator, Splash Capital, RocketCap, Digital Virtues</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="focus" class="border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-950">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl">
        Our investment focus
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400">
        We like to invest in things that no one cares about. Yet.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 shadow-soft">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-50">Scope</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
            Non-consensus insight-driven ideas based on inflection points.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 shadow-soft">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-50">Founders</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
            Obsessed founder teams who want to make a dent in the universe.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 shadow-soft">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-50">Phase & Tickets</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
            Pre-product market fit (Pre-Seed/Seed) with initial tickets around $300k in Europe, North America, and Asia.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="team" class="border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/80">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr,1fr] lg:items-center">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl">
            What our founders say about us
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400">
            No founders were harmed in the making of this statement.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/40 p-6 shadow-soft">
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-100">
              “Blockchain Founders Capital relentlessly supported us during our fundraising, even before the paperwork was
              signed. I completely trust them and plan to be lifelong partners.”
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-50">
              Raechel Lambert
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              CEO & Co-Founder of River
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-5">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-50">
            It takes a village to raise a startup
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
            We share ideas, learn from, and co-invest with the leading minds in the blockchain and venture capital
            community.
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs text-slate-300 sm:grid-cols-3">
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/40 px-3 py-2">
              Animoca Brands
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/40 px-3 py-2">
              Sequoia
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/40 px-3 py-2">
              Dragonfly
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/40 px-3 py-2">
              Y Combinator
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/40 px-3 py-2">
              TechStars
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/40 px-3 py-2">
              Many more
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="snapshots" class="border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-950">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl">
            Meeting founders, investors and friends
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400">
            Click on any photo to jump to snapshots.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 flex gap-4 overflow-x-auto pb-2">
        <article class="min-w-[240px] max-w-xs flex-1 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-900 to-slate-800/80 p-4 shadow-soft">
          <p class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-300">
            With Jesse Jeng, General Partner of Scalehouse Capital at Frankfurt School
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="min-w-[240px] max-w-xs flex-1 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-900 to-slate-800/80 p-4 shadow-soft">
          <p class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-300">
            At the European Blockchain Convention in Barcelona – Outlook for VCs in 2026
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="min-w-[240px] max-w-xs flex-1 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-900 to-slate-800/80 p-4 shadow-soft">
          <p class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-300">
            With Yat Siu, Founder and Chairman Animoca Brands
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="min-w-[240px] max-w-xs flex-1 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-900 to-slate-800/80 p-4 shadow-soft">
          <p class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-300">
            With founders, investors, and friends at Dinner &amp; Wine
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="news" class="border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/90">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl">
            What we have been up to
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400">
            Don't forget to subscribe to our newsletter.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 shadow-soft">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-400">
              Insights
            </p>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-50">
              The Davos Investor Summit 2026
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              Industry leaders discuss how policy, tokenization, and institutional adoption are reshaping the global
              financial system. The next era is here.
            </p>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-500">
            Jan 30, 2025 · 15 mins
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 shadow-soft">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-400">
              Newsletters
            </p>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-50">
              Friends &amp; Family BFC Notebook #20
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              To unicorn or not, make underwriters great again, reviving an empire instrument and the study of 1929.
            </p>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-500">
            Dec 7, 2025 · 10 mins
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 shadow-soft">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-400">
              Portfolio
            </p>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-50">
              Why we invested in Herita
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              Herita digitizes the ancient Bill of Exchange, giving manufacturers captive finance without being a bank.
            </p>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-500">
            Nov 7, 2025 · 10 mins
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="connect" class="bg-slate-950">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr,1fr] lg:items-center">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl">
            Connect with us
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
            Driven by empathy and relentlessness, we look beyond surface-level presentations to uncover what truly fuels
            founders—their passions, challenges, immigrant backgrounds, and often crazy childhoods.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/40 p-6 shadow-soft">
          <form class="space-y-4">
            <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
              <input
                type="text"
                placeholder="Name"
                class="h-10 rounded-full border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/80 px-4 text-sm text-slate-50 placeholder:text-slate-500 shadow-soft focus:border-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-0"
              />
              <input
                type="email"
                placeholder="Email"
                class="h-10 rounded-full border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/80 px-4 text-sm text-slate-50 placeholder:text-slate-500 shadow-soft focus:border-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-0"
              />
            </div>
            <textarea
              rows="3"
              placeholder="Tell us about your mission"
              class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/80 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-50 placeholder:text-slate-500 shadow-soft focus:border-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-0"
            />
            <button
              type="submit"
              class="inline-flex h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-50 px-6 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 shadow-soft hover:bg-white sm:w-auto"
            >
              Send message
            </button>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

